# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
#
# Device tree overlays for Rockchip boards (migrated from the 6.1 BSP, whose
# sources were named .dts; the mainline kbuild rules carried by this kernel
# build %.dtbo from %.dtso only).
#
# A .dtbo is applied on top of a base .dtb either at build time through the
# "<target>-dtbs" mechanism of scripts/Makefile.dtbs (which also enables
# __symbols__ for that base) or at runtime by the bootloader.  The runtime path
# resolves the overlay __fixups__ against the __symbols__ of the base DTB, so
# the parent Makefile passes -@ to every board DTB.
